/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 594 0 R
/E (In Stage 2, Logistic Regression \(linear model\) was retained for its baseline performance, Random Forest was added to reduce bias and capture non-linear patterns through ensemble learning, and the Stacked LR + SVM \(linear + distance-based\) model was included to leverage complementary strengths, aiming to maximize F1 and Recall for stroke prediction, with Logistic Regression as the final estimator for stable, interpretable probabilistic predictions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
